# (0.18) "gtest f" on the text shell: a full-screen picture (320x180: a status panel by the
# split, a scrolled playfield wrapping at row 180, three sprites, two raster colours), then
# Alt+Esc: the full-screen window is minimized and the desktop is back as it was; Alt+Tab
# brings it back (the full screen again), q ends it (the text shell again).
1500 {esc}
+1500 gtest f\n
+3000 {dE2}
+100 {esc}
+100 {uE2}
+2000 {dE2}
+100 {d2B}
+100 {u2B}
+100 {uE2}
+2000 q
